# Built-in JSON editor for everything the form does not cover, validated while you type.
Output ".vhs/json.gif"
Source "docs/tapes/config.tape"

Hide
Type "lazy1mcp" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Down 3
Sleep 1s
Type "E"
Sleep 500ms
Down 8
Ctrl+E
Enter
Type '"cwd": "~/projects",'
Sleep 500ms
Show
Sleep 300ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/json.png"
Sleep 500ms
